1. RPLIDAR A1M8 3D model
   File:     3dmodels/RPLIDAR_A1M8.step
   Source:   turtlebot4_description/meshes/rplidar.dae
             https://github.com/turtlebot/turtlebot4 (branch: humble)
             Package maintained by Clearpath Robotics.
   Licence:  Apache License, Version 2.0
             Full text: 3dmodels/LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt
             https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

   Modifications (per Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
   The original COLLADA mesh was converted to a faceted STEP solid using
   OpenCASCADE. It was rotated and translated into KiCad footprint
   coordinates: origin at the scan axis, +Y toward the motor, and Z = 0 at
   the bottom of the standoffs. No other changes were made to the geometry.

   Derived data:
   The board outline, mounting-hole positions and under-body clearances in
   this project were measured from the same mesh.

2. Reference data
   SLAMTEC "RPLIDAR A1 Introduction and Datasheet, Model A1M8", rev 3.0
